<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pagina niet gevonden &middot; Lorenzo Greidanus</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@600&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><rect width='100' height='100' rx='26' fill='%23204ECF'/><text x='50' y='68' font-family='Poppins,Arial' font-size='46' font-weight='600' fill='%23FBF6F1' text-anchor='middle'>LG</text></svg>">
<style>
:root{--crab:#F26749;--amber:#EA9836;--ocean:#204ECF;--vista:#83A5F2;--sand:#FCDED6;--room:#FBF6F1;--ink:#14224C}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:32px;
  background:var(--room);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Poppins',system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center}
.hand{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:1.8rem;color:var(--crab)}
h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,14vw,7rem);font-weight:600;margin:.2rem 0;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ocean)}
p{color:#5b6480;max-width:38ch;margin:0 auto 26px}
a.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--crab);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;
  padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 10px 0 rgba(20,34,76,.08);transition:transform .16s ease}
a.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.strip{display:flex;height:8px;width:170px;margin:34px auto 0;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden}
.strip i{flex:1}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div>
  <span class="hand">hmm, die is er niet</span>
  <h1>404</h1>
  <p>Deze pagina bestaat niet of is verhuisd. Ga terug naar de startpagina en probeer het opnieuw.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/">Terug naar de startpagina</a>
  <div class="strip" aria-hidden="true">
    <i style="background:var(--crab)"></i><i style="background:var(--amber)"></i><i style="background:var(--ocean)"></i><i style="background:var(--vista)"></i><i style="background:var(--sand)"></i>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
